{"parse": {"title": "衣着/休假日", "pageid": 55579, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"character-skin-page\"><div class=\"character-base-info\"><div class=\"character-img-box0 tabber\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div class=\"character-img-box1\"><div class=\"tabber-item hide-m\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"Skin_bg-305703.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit-height\" style=\"position:absolute; right:0; height:100%;display:none;\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2\"><img alt=\"Zhujiemian you di.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bc/Zhujiemian_you_di.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"508\" height=\"612\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" data-file-width=\"508\" data-file-height=\"612\" /></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item\" data-id=\"305703\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-tabberimg=\"Portrait-305703.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" data-tabberimglink=\"File:Portrait-305703.webp\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"L2d_static-305703_xmsme_p.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" data-tabberimglink=\"File:L2d_static-305703_xmsme_p.webp\" style=\"display:none;\"></div></div><div class=\"character-desc-offset\"><div class=\"character-img-button-group\"><div class=\"tabber-filter l2d-button-group\"><div class=\"l2d-button\"><img alt=\"Btm lihui.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4d/Btm_lihui.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"84\" data-file-height=\"84\" /></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"0\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-type=\"isl2d\">L2D</div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-type=\"isl2d\">立绘</div></div></div></div><div class=\"img-desc img-desc-only\" style=\"position:relative; padding-bottom:25px\">不曾谋面的新鲜世界。</div><div class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-305703 xmsmr.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/19/Spine_static-305703_xmsmr.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"208\" height=\"486\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"208\" data-file-height=\"486\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3057\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E6%A2%85%E6%96%AF%E6%A2%85%E5%B0%94\" title=\"小梅斯梅尔\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E6%A2%85%E6%96%AF%E6%A2%85%E5%B0%94\" title=\"小梅斯梅尔\"><img alt=\"小梅斯梅尔\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E6%A2%85%E6%96%AF%E6%A2%85%E5%B0%94\" title=\"小梅斯梅尔\">小梅斯梅尔</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.9</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>新世界的风</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：305703</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">在慕尼黑繁华的街头，她第一次骑上那辆巨轮车。巨大的轮子并不好掌控，她在街道上留下歪斜的辙痕。<br />但想要学会这种历经了悠久传承的工具并不算难，只需要一点点关于平衡的练习——<br />齿轮精准地咬合，日暮的风向后擦过她的脸颊。望着金色的余晖，她在某一个瞬间忘记了雨声——那未曾到来的，那已经离去的，那永远使神经紧绷着的雨声。<br />这是一片稳定的新世界。胸口那枚家族传承的宝石，也不再以其重量来干扰她的思绪，她扬起了一抹不易察觉的笑容。<br />也许有一天，所有人都能够自由地走在街头上。阳光洒落，就好像雨声从未存在。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"305703\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/38/Belonging-305704.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">经典贝雷帽<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Vintage Beret</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />6.88<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一顶经典款式的贝雷帽，上面几乎没有过多的褶皱。与其说是对藏品的珍惜，更可能的缘由是来自受访者不自觉的反复打理。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/ba/Belonging-305705.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“崭新的发明”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"The Intricate Device\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一件拉普拉斯制的桌面摆件。在曲柄与齿轮的精准咬合下，其中的所有轮毂都能以统一的协调频率旋转。<br />“你在想什么，它当然不能用来催眠。”受访者对这一推测相当惊讶。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-305706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/79/Belonging-305706.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“梅斯梅尔”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Mesmer\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>梅斯梅尔家族世代传承的珍贵藏品之一，曾在某任女王的舞池中大放异彩，也曾多次在某军方贵族的游猎活动中表现惹眼，承载着厚重的家族历史。<br />而今，它收获了一位新主人，也终于卸下了沉重的担子。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A51.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 休假日1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A51.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A51.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A51.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A51.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A51.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A51.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A52.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 休假日2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A52.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A52.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A52.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A52.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A52.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BC%91%E5%81%87%E6%97%A52.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">休假日 <small style=\"color: grey\">A Day to Rest</small></span></span>"}}